Firmware-derived strings
========================

src/data/a9_fn_functions.json contains function symbol names and saved-value
bytes read from the public firmware of the ILCE-9 (version 6.00) for the sole
purpose of addressing the camera's own function table.

src/data/a9_fn_chinese_names.json contains 77 Chinese menu labels, 64 of which
were matched against the camera's own Chinese UI resources. These strings are
reproduced only so that the tool shows the same wording the user sees on the
camera. No rights over them are claimed, and no firmware binary, key, or
unpacked firmware artifact is distributed with this project.

